<!-- 
============================================
CRUD PAGE - views/crud.ejs
============================================

Single Page Application for CRUD operations using jQuery and AJAX
Demonstrates Create, Read, Update, Delete without page refresh

VIVA TIP: "This is a Single Page Application that performs
CRUD operations asynchronously using AJAX. It demonstrates
client-side manipulation and API integration."
-->

<!-- Page-specific CSS -->
<% style %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/crud-style.css">
<% /style %>

<!-- Loading Spinner (Hidden initially) -->
<div class="spinner-overlay" id="spinner">
    <div class="text-center">
        <div class="spinner-border text-primary" role="status">
            <span class="visually-hidden">Loading...</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2">Loading...</div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Main CRUD Interface -->
<main class="app-container">
    
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4">
        <h2 class="mb-0">Posts — Single Page CRUD</h2>
        <small class="text-muted">Demo using jQuery AJAX + JSONPlaceholder API</small>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        
        <!-- LEFT COLUMN: Create/Edit Form -->
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
            
            <!-- Form Card -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 id="form-title">Create Post</h5>
                    
                    <!-- 
                    FORM
                    
                    WHY novalidate?
                    - We handle validation in JavaScript
                    - More control over error messages
                    - Custom validation logic
                    -->
                    <form id="postForm" novalidate>
                        
                        <!-- Hidden field for edit mode (stores post ID) -->
                        <input type="hidden" id="postId" value="">
                        
                        <!-- User ID -->
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label for="userId" class="form-label">User ID</label>
                            <input type="number" 
                                   id="userId" 
                                   class="form-control" 
                                   placeholder="e.g. 1" 
                                   required>
                            <div class="invalid-feedback">User ID is required.</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Title -->
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label for="title" class="form-label">Title</label>
                            <input type="text" 
                                   id="title" 
                                   class="form-control" 
                                   placeholder="Post title" 
                                   required>
                            <div class="invalid-feedback">Title is required.</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Body -->
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label for="body" class="form-label">Body</label>
                            <textarea id="body" 
                                      class="form-control" 
                                      rows="5" 
                                      placeholder="Post content" 
                                      required></textarea>
                            <div class="invalid-feedback">Body is required.</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Action Buttons -->
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                            <button type="submit" 
                                    id="submitBtn" 
                                    class="btn btn-primary">
                                Create
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" 
                                    id="resetBtn" 
                                    class="btn btn-outline-secondary">
                                Reset
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- API Info -->
                        <div class="mt-3">
                            <small class="text-muted">
                                Uses <code>https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts</code>
                            </small>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Info Card -->
            <div class="card mt-3">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6>📝 Notes</h6>
                    <ul class="mb-0">
                        <li>JSONPlaceholder returns fake success responses (id=101, etc.)</li>
                        <li>No actual persistence — useful for UI & API practice</li>
                        <li>All actions happen without reloading the page (SPA)</li>
                        <li>Client-side state management demonstration</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Statistics Card -->
            <div class="card mt-3">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6>📊 Statistics</h6>
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2">
                        <span>Total Posts:</span>
                        <strong><span id="count">0</span></strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                        <span>Status:</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-secondary" id="loadingBadge" style="display:none">
                            Loading
                        </span>
                        <span class="badge bg-success" id="readyBadge" style="display:none">
                            Ready
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT COLUMN: Posts List -->
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    
                    <!-- List Header -->
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
                        <h5 class="mb-0">Posts List</h5>
                        <div>
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-primary me-2" 
                                    id="reloadBtn"
                                    title="Reload posts from API">
                                🔄 Reload
                            </button>
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-danger" 
                                    id="clearBtn"
                                    title="Clear all posts (client-side only)">
                                🗑️ Clear List
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Search/Filter (Future Enhancement) -->
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <input type="text" 
                               id="searchBox" 
                               class="form-control" 
                               placeholder="🔍 Search posts by title...">
                    </div>

                    <!-- Posts Table -->
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="table table-striped table-hover table-nowrap" id="postsTable">
                            <thead class="table-light">
                                <tr>
                                    <th style="width:70px">ID</th>
                                    <th style="width:80px">User</th>
                                    <th>Title</th>
                                    <th style="width:160px">Actions</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <!-- Rows will be injected here by JavaScript -->
                                <!-- See crud-script.js renderPosts() function -->
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Summary Footer -->
                    <div class="mt-3 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                        <div id="summary" class="text-muted">
                            Showing <span id="count-footer">0</span> posts
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="badge bg-info">Client-side SPA</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- API Endpoints Info Card -->
            <div class="card mt-3">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6>🔌 API Endpoints Used</h6>
                    <table class="table table-sm mb-0">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Method</th>
                                <th>Endpoint</th>
                                <th>Action</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="badge bg-success">GET</span></td>
                                <td><code>/posts</code></td>
                                <td>List all posts</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="badge bg-primary">POST</span></td>
                                <td><code>/posts</code></td>
                                <td>Create new post</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="badge bg-warning">PUT</span></td>
                                <td><code>/posts/:id</code></td>
                                <td>Update post</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="badge bg-danger">DELETE</span></td>
                                <td><code>/posts/:id</code></td>
                                <td>Delete post</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<!-- Toast Notifications Container -->
<div class="position-fixed bottom-0 end-0 p-3" style="z-index: 1200">
    <div id="toastContainer"></div>
</div>

<!-- Page-specific Scripts -->
<% script %>
<!-- jQuery (required for AJAX and DOM manipulation) -->
<script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>

<!-- CRUD Operations Script -->
<script src="/javascripts/crud-script.js"></script>

<!-- Optional: Search functionality -->
<script>
// Simple client-side search
document.getElementById('searchBox')?.addEventListener('input', function(e) {
    const searchTerm = e.target.value.toLowerCase();
    const rows = document.querySelectorAll('#postsTable tbody tr');
    
    rows.forEach(row => {
        const title = row.querySelector('td:nth-child(3)')?.textContent.toLowerCase();
        if (title && title.includes(searchTerm)) {
            row.style.display = '';
        } else {
            row.style.display = 'none';
        }
    });
});
</script>
<% /script %>

<!-- 
============================================
HOW THIS WORKS (VIVA EXPLANATION)
============================================

1. PAGE LOAD:
   - crud-script.js runs loadPosts()
   - Makes AJAX GET request to API
   - Receives JSON array of posts
   - Renders posts in table

2. CREATE POST:
   - User fills form and clicks "Create"
   - Form validation runs (client-side)
   - AJAX POST request with form data
   - API returns new post with ID
   - Add to local posts array
   - Re-render table
   - Show success toast

3. EDIT POST:
   - User clicks "Edit" button on a post
   - Populate form with post data
   - Change button to "Update"
   - Set hidden postId field

4. UPDATE POST:
   - User clicks "Update" button
   - AJAX PUT request with post ID
   - API returns updated post
   - Update local posts array
   - Re-render table
   - Reset form

5. DELETE POST:
   - User clicks "Delete" button
   - Show confirmation dialog
   - AJAX DELETE request with post ID
   - Remove from local posts array
   - Re-render table
   - Show success toast

============================================
KEY CONCEPTS (VIVA)
============================================

Q: What is SPA (Single Page Application)?
A: Web app that doesn't reload the page. All updates
   happen dynamically with JavaScript. Better UX,
   feels more like a desktop app.

Q: What is AJAX?
A: Asynchronous JavaScript and XML. Allows making
   HTTP requests without page reload. Used with
   XMLHttpRequest or fetch/$.ajax.

Q: Why use JSONPlaceholder?
A: Free fake API for testing and prototyping.
   Returns realistic responses without needing
   a real backend during development.

Q: What's the difference between client-side and server-side?
A: Client-side: Runs in browser (JavaScript)
   Server-side: Runs on server (Node.js/Express)
   This page does client-side state management.

Q: How does form validation work here?
A: jQuery checks fields on submit. If invalid,
   adds .is-invalid class and shows error message.
   Prevents form submission until valid.

============================================
FUTURE ENHANCEMENTS
============================================

1. PAGINATION
   Show 10 posts per page with next/prev buttons

2. SORTING
   Click table headers to sort by ID, title, etc.

3. FILTERING
   Filter by user ID or date range

4. REAL DATABASE
   Connect to MongoDB/MySQL instead of fake API

5. AUTHENTICATION
   Only allow logged-in users to edit/delete

6. RICH TEXT EDITOR
   Use TinyMCE or Quill for post body

7. IMAGE UPLOAD
   Allow attaching images to posts

8. REAL-TIME UPDATES
   Use WebSockets for live updates when others edit
-->